B.a4B=s(["You decide when each receiver turns on.","Vous d\xe9cidez quand chaque r\xe9cepteur s\u2019allume.","Du bestimmst, wann jeder Receiver angeht."],t.s)
B.a7Q=s(["You decide when each LED line turns on.","Vous d\xe9cidez quand chaque ligne LED s\u2019allume.","Du bestimmst, wann jede LED-Linie angeht."],t.s)
